From: =?utf-8?q?Jonas_=C3=85dahl?= <jadahl@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Nov 2025 14:58:38 +0100
Subject: Remove libgnome-rr

It's not used by anything, and uses API that doesn't really work
anymore. Remove it.

(cherry picked from commit c030c7763402069e9fdcc72e31dcf799f8052d26)

Origin: 51.alpha
